    "cardType": "CONCEPT",
    "front": "How do you write a fraction in its simplest form?",
    "back": "Divide the numerator and the denominator by their highest common factor.",
    "notes": "$\\frac{36}{48} = \\frac{3}{4}$ (divide by 12).",
    "concepts": [
      "math.number.fractions-decimals-percentages"
